/E (Applying this model, the study first reconceptualises liberal arts education not as the mere possession of knowledge, but as the embodiment of shared values through dialogue and as a community-building project for critical inquiry. In the context of rapidly advancing AI technologies, it further argues that the core value of bilingual education lies not in language acquisition per se, but in a practice that renders visible the contexts embedded in each language and enables movement across them.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
