/E (Everyone uses some kind of e-Commerce platform in their daily lives to some degree, but with all globalizations, the ideas, values and experiences of online shoppers vary widely. But why is that? The differences between the two groups of e-Commerce platforms, the Chinese and American platforms. American platforms being Amazon and eBay, whereas the Chinese platforms are Shopee, Taobao, and Pinduoduo. Amazon has its own product lines and promotes its own products with its recommendations, whereas Taobao feels like an endless scroll and promotes live-streams and other media outside of its own. Pinduoduo, Shopee, Taobao and Amazon all promote tons of products on their home screen, but Amazon does not have an infinite number of products on its home screen. Unlike these two groups, Chinese and Americans both have access to Temu and Shein, but their access to it )
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [8]
>>
