/P 387 0 R
/E (Modern urban planning is mostly focused on greening, and the frequency of street trees and other green plants on the streets is gradually increasing. Through the Taichung Green Railway in my own living area and the famous High Line Park in New York, I was inspired to think about the impact of urban green belts on the environment. So I created this explanatory poster by referring to online literature.)
/Pg 57 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
