/E (Fast fashion has become increasingly popular due to its affordability, accessibility, and ability to quickly follow current trends. However, the rapid production and consumption of clothing have also created significant environmental concerns, including textile waste, pollution, and increased carbon emissions. This study investigates public awareness of the environmental impacts of fast fashion and examines consumer purchasing behaviors through a questionnaire survey.)
/Pg 65 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
