/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 400 0 R
/E (The results showed that all samples retained the monoclinic scheelite phase, indicating that alkali-metal dopants incorporation did not change the crystal structure. However, Na doping at 5 mol%, produced stronger structural and smaller crystallite than Li doping. Optical measurements further revealed enhanced visible-light absorption for all doped samples compared with the baseline BiVO4, with Na-doped BiVO4 showing the strongest absorbance across the visible range. In the conditions, a 0.6 mL stock concentration provided the best balance between signal quality and spectral stability. Preliminary characterization also confirmed successful synthesis of N/CQDs, although these were not yet integrated into BiVO4.)
/Pg 70 0 R
/K [1]
>>
